Several mage buff spells can now be cast on your entire group at once.
Cast without specifying a target to buff all group members in the room,
or specify a target for single-target mode as before.

Updated spells: haste, flight, gills of flesh, accelerate, stealth,
feathery descent, falcon wings, sorcerer's globe.

The redundant group-only versions of flight and gills of flesh --
antigravity and breath of Sarahage -- have been removed. Flight and
gills of flesh now cover both single-target and group use cases.
